Package: ESSP
Title: Energy Data Pipeline for the Energy Security Studies Program
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Energy Security Studies Program", , , "sandhuanitesh@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Gathering, interpretation, and visualization commands for
    energy research. Wraps the U.S. Energy Information Administration API
    with a plain-English topic vocabulary, derives standard research
    variables, and renders the program's house chart styles.
